      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crash Reports"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allgemein": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Angemeldet als": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signed in as"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anmeldung": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign-in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auf %@ übersetzen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translate to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aus Videos, Webseiten, Fotos oder Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From videos, websites, photos or text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aus der Mediathek": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From your library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ausblenden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bei YouTube-Links liest die App Titel und Beschreibung über die YouTube-API-Dienste; dabei geht nur die Video-ID an Google. [YouTube-Nutzungsbedingungen](https://www.youtube.com/t/terms) · [Datenschutzerklärung von Google](https://policies.google.com/privacy)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For YouTube links, the app reads the title and description through YouTube API Services; only the video ID is sent to Google. [YouTube Terms of Service](https://www.youtube.com/t/terms) · [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Benutzername oder E-Mail": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Username or email"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Danke, dass du hilfst, die App besser zu machen! Beschreib kurz, was passiert ist oder was du dir wünschst.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thanks for helping to make the app better! Briefly describe what happened or what you'd like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Protokoll zeigt, was die App seit dem Start getan hat, etwa importierte Links und Fehlermeldungen – aber keine Passwörter, Tokens oder Server-Adresse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The log shows what the app has done since it started, such as imported links and error messages – but no passwords, tokens or server address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Datenschutz": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Passwort wird nicht gespeichert. Die App legt damit einen eigenen API-Token in Mealie an.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your password isn't stored. The app uses it to create its own API token in Mealie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo beenden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End Demo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der API-Token wird von diesem Gerät entfernt. Deine Rezepte bleiben in Mealie.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API token is removed from this device. Your recipes stay in Mealie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server ist nicht erreichbar (%@). Stimmt die Adresse?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server can't be reached (%@). Is the address correct?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnose": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnose & Absturzberichte": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostics & Crash Reports"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die App selbst sammelt keine Daten und nutzt keine Analyse- oder Werbedienste. Nur für die Vorschau fragt sie bei YouTube bzw. der Webseite Titel und Vorschaubild ab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app itself collects no data and uses no analytics or advertising services. Only for previews does it fetch the title and thumbnail from YouTube or the website."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese Angaben werden mitgeschickt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These details are included"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "E-Mail": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Email"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "E-Mail schreiben": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write an Email"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einen API-Token erstellst du in Mealie unter **Profil → API-Tokens**. Er wird sicher im Schlüsselbund gespeichert.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create an API token in Mealie under **Profile → API Tokens**. It is stored securely in the keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einstellungen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enthält die Meldungen der App seit dem letzten Start: Importe, Fehler und Serverantworten. Keine Passwörter oder Tokens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contains the app's messages since it was last started: imports, errors and server responses. No passwords or tokens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erneut versuchen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try Again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback geben": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send Feedback"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fehler melden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Report a Bug"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fotos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fotos und Text auf dem iPhone verarbeiten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Process photos and text on iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fotos und Texte wertet die App auf dem iPhone aus, wenn das oben eingeschaltet ist. Dein Mealie-Server bekommt dann nur das fertige Rezept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When turned on above, the app processes photos and text on your iPhone. Your Mealie server then only receives the finished recipe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für Video-Importe braucht Mealie einen KI-Anbieter mit Audio-Transkription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For video imports, Mealie needs an AI provider with audio transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hallo, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hello, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
